        "Searching Past OpenCode Sessions from session.db - Zenn\nDatabase First, a quick check on OpenCode's database. DB Format and Storage Location OpenCode session data is managed in an SQLite database, stored at the following paths depending on the platform: macOS/Linux: ~/.local/share/opencode/ Windows: %USERPROFILE%\\.local\\share\\opencode"
